	(text "04 Measurement (PLAN section 3): four shunt amplifiers (50 mohm, gain 6.25 around MID = 1.5 V: 0.3125 V/A, +-4 A into 0.25-2.75 V, about 20 MHz), six dividers 1/173.4 (520 V full scale) with buffers, two TMUX1308 8:1 muxes with a shared FPGA-driven address MUX_A0..2, two ADS7056 with shared ADC_CS / ADC_SCK and their own SDO. Mux 1 (bridge 1): 0 I_L1, 1 I_C1, 2 V_ANODE, 3 UC1, 4 RAW (B_P), 5 MID, 6 NTC1, 7 GND. Mux 2 (bridge 2): 0 I_C2, 1 I_L2, 2 V_SCREEN, 3 UC2, 4 RAW (UIN), 5 MID, 6 NTC2, 7 GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 17.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b4d47f47-0e85-505f-ae2e-efce1c2b6d37")
	)
